{"4245190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bartender Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 4245190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bartender Life Simulator&quot; is a game where you take on the role of a bartender and owner of a small establishment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle rented a small space for you and, with the words &quot;Make a profit,&quot; left you to figure everything out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think a bartender's main job is to mix delicious cocktails? Not here—your primary task is to listen to customers who don't mind taking advice from a stranger behind the bar. Be careful, though, because someone might actually follow your suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, don't forget about the cocktails. Purchase ingredients and mix drinks, steadily boosting your bar's reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a cozy atmosphere—the kind of place you'd want to visit yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember, between taking orders and playing therapist, you need to take breaks and spend your free time however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your advice lead to something good or bad? Will your bar earn a reputation as the best, or remain just &quot;one of many&quot;? That's for you to find out.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bartender Life Simulator&quot; is a game where you take on the role of a bartender and owner of a small establishment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle rented a small space for you and, with the words &quot;Make a profit,&quot; left you to figure everything out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think a bartender's main job is to mix delicious cocktails? Not here—your primary task is to listen to customers who don't mind taking advice from a stranger behind the bar. Be careful, though, because someone might actually follow your suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/a74039673ce0d780b893532c5af2e9b9.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, don't forget about the cocktails. Purchase ingredients and mix drinks, steadily boosting your bar's reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/2c547aaf26aa578571b66fb0b5cf895a.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a cozy atmosphere—the kind of place you'd want to visit yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/c8dee6b736f832ea7f74471ea832fa2b.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember, between taking orders and playing therapist, you need to take breaks and spend your free time however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.poster.avif?t=1782318658\" width=700 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.webm?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/extras/4ad2e8188e58c651efcfc1181e3116dd.mp4?t=1782318658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your advice lead to something good or bad? Will your bar earn a reputation as the best, or remain just &quot;one of many&quot;? That's for you to find out.</p>", "short_description": "What is a bar owner to you? A manager? A bartender? An interior designer? A psychologist? And what if you had to take on all these roles? Interact with customers, manage supplies, craft cocktails, and redesign the interior to earn the title of the best bar.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/0cd9862420be33080fbb5ed0e1cced6a3e5ec6aa/header.jpg?t=1782318658", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/f0f43f5054aebac9d4a0cc6262e6a0dcccce1e76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782318658", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245190/f0f43f5054aebac9d4a0cc6262e6a0dcccce1e76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782318658", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-4670 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": [" LetiGames"], "publishers": [" LetiGames"], "demos": [{"appid": 4380450, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "fin